      "value": "@{5bbfe7082f9bdf3d5024c14d|full_name}: You're absolutely right! Totally slipped my mind.\n.... Buuuut I didn't get the impression that this would be something built into VRChat in general, but rather a tool for world creators to use. It'll be a definite improvement! But I'm in favor of making it as accessible as possible 😋\n... Eh. If it's part the official analytics feature, that'll probably be good enough. Either way - looking foward to it.",
