      "mergeID": "698a3d04b1291df5937462c9",
      "mergedPostDetails": "It would be nice for there to be a \"Report Bugs\" button on a world (in game, web page, or both) which you could click and then write a short message to that world's builder, so that you can directly report bugs you find in their world to them.\n\nTo avoid abuse, maybe restrict access to that button to the upper trust levels.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Bug Report button for Worlds",
