  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-05-05T13:22:45.954Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Let visitors of a world send text feedback to its creator.\n\n# As a world creator...\nIt's challenging to get feedback. Unless I personally interview visitors of my worlds, I only hear from a vocal minority *outside* VRChat.\n\n# As a user...\nIt's difficult to get in touch with world creators. Most users seem to send random friend requests to creators, which usually get rejected. And exiting VRChat to go to a creator's Twitter or Discord is a burden.\n\n# Suggestion\nLet us send one-way messages to VRChat world creators.\nThis would massively reduce the effort needed to message world creators. And world creators would massively benefit from hearing what players actually think.\n(Just hearing positive feedback has massively improved my mental health!)",
